GitGit

Portions of this software are adapted from Gitea (https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea),
Copyright The Gitea Authors, Copyright The Gogs Authors, released under the MIT license.

Adapted components:
- The persistent `git cat-file --batch-command` object-read engine
  (gitengine.go) follows the design of Gitea's modules/git catfile batch
  implementation (modules/git/catfile_batch*.go).
- The repository archive endpoint (raw.go: serveArchive) follows the pattern
  of Gitea's modules/git/archive.go.
- Tag listing (gitengine.go: listTags) follows Gitea's for-each-ref usage in
  modules/git.

These are independent reimplementations informed by Gitea's approach; no
Gitea source is compiled into this project. A copy of the MIT license under
which Gitea is distributed is reproduced below.

